vered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d5\"},\"ref\":\"d5\",\"snippet\":\" ... In 1991, Pesci earned an Oscar for Best Supporting Actor for his portrayal of real-life gangster Tommy DeVito in Goodfellas and two additional nominations in the same category for Raging Bull (1980) and The Irishman. Apart from acting, Pesci has dappled in music, having released three studio ... \",\"title\":\"https://people.com/movies/home-alone-cast-where-are-they-now/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d6\"},\"ref\":\"d6\",\"snippet\":\" ... Grammer received award recognitions for portraying this character on these two shows, in addition to a 1992 one-time appearance on Wings. For his portrayal on Cheers, Grammer was nominated twice for Outstanding Supporting Actor in a Comedy Series but did not win in that category. For portraying ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frasier_Crane\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d7\"},\"ref\":\"d7\",\"snippet\":\" ... Happily married to Jong-Bae (Go Soo), Jeong-Yeon dotes on their young child and the cozy life they've carved out for themselves. But after one of Jong-Bae's friends dies by suicide to escape his debts, they face financial ruin. As the co-signer on ... \",\"title\":\"https://jaehakim.substack.com/p/7-prison-k-drama-one-ordinary-day-move-to-heaven\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d8\"},\"ref\":\"d8\",\"snippet\":\" ... He was married to Jeanne Desclois and Renée de Pont-Jest. He died on 1 June 1925 in Paris, France.\\n\\n- Hans Lanser-Ludolff was born on 19 June 1860 in Bonn, Germany. He was an actor, known for The Call of the Child (1914), Wer wirft den ersten ... \",\"title\":\