3 or 4 times one child alive\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_2a1428b65efa49d297d683f9"},{"content":"The clues strongly suggest a soap opera character. \"Married more than 2 but less than 5 times\" = 3 or 4 marriages, \"only one child survives,\" and \"plays alongside a real-life relative.\" Let me search for specific soap opera characters with these traits.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": \"soap opera character married three times one surviving child actor real life relative plays together\\\", \\\"character married four times one child alive series actor sibling real life\\\", \\\"TV character married 3 times only one child survives actor plays with real life family member\\\"]\", \"top_k\": 10}","name":"search"},"id":"call_cf53ee08e6564af6913ed16a","index":0,"type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"blocks_finish\":true,\"code\":\"arguments_invalid\",\"executed\":false,\"message\":\"search: invalid fields near ['queries']; follow the supplied schema\",\"ok\":false}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_cf53ee08e6564af6913ed16a"},{"content":"Current control state (data, not source evidence):\n{\"current_notes_not_evidence\":[],\"evidence_shelf\":{\"omitted_for_capacity\":[],\"restored_exact_windows\":[],\"selection\":\"bounded recent first-delivery order; not a relevance/verification judgment\"},\"feedback\":{\"blocks_finish\":true,\"code\":\"arguments_invalid\",\"message\":\"search: invalid fields near ['queries']; follow the supplied schema\",\"no_automatic_parameter_repair\":true,\"ok\":false,\"tool\":\"search\"},\"instruction\":\"Read only useful passages. Notes and all-page cleanup are optional.\",\"literal_answer_contract\":{\"origin\":\"explicit experiment configuration, not inferred from question\",\"prefix\":\"\",\"suffix\":\"\"},\"phase\":\"RESEARCH\",\"remaining\":{\"action_slots\":198,\"backend_calls\":117,\"model_calls\":14,\"output_reservation\":47743},\"research